<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3164" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκιδνός</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span></span>, 
			Ep.
		 and 
			Ion.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>weak, feeble</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> only in <i><span class="en">
				Od.
			</span></i>, always in 
				Comp.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἶδος ἀκιδνότερος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					8.169
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				5.217
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				18.130
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				224
			</span></i>; later in Posit., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δμωαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Man.
					2.178
				</span></i>
			: 
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ότατον, βέλεμνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					7.270
				</span></i>
			; <i>insipid</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔδεσμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Archestr.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					38
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i> (s. v.l., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καὶ κεδνόν</span>
			Meineke, Brandt).—
				Ep.
			 word, also in <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰατρός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Praec.</u>
					8
				</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύναμις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Nat.Puer.</u>
					30
				</span></i>
			.</div>
